<color_white>Welcome to Ruins of Eternal Struggle v1.0!</color>

<color_light_gray>A post-apocalyptic turn-based survival game.</color>
<color_light_gray>Explore, scavenge, craft, and fight to survive in a</color>
<color_light_gray>world overrun by the undead and worse.</color>

<color_white>About the project:</color>
<color_yellow>* </color><color_light_gray>The project is under active development — new</color>
<color_yellow>  </color><color_light_gray>content and improvements are added regularly.</color>
<color_yellow>* </color><color_light_gray>Our own vision of balance and gameplay — more</color>
<color_yellow>  </color><color_light_gray>accessible without losing depth.</color>
<color_yellow>* </color><color_light_gray>Unique mechanics, items, locations, and story</color>
<color_yellow>  </color><color_light_gray>events are planned for future updates.</color>
<color_yellow>* </color><color_light_gray>Your ideas matter — suggest them on GitHub!</color>

<color_white>Report bugs, suggestions and follow development:</color>
<color_light_gray>* Github: </color><color_light_cyan>https://github.com/VirusAid/Ruins-of-Eternal-Struggle-</color>
<color_light_gray>* Discord: </color><color_light_cyan>https://discord.gg/8CHaDh2KTf</color>

